{"words": [{"text": "يُرِيدُ", "translation": "Wishes"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "يُخَفِّفَ", "translation": "lighten"}, {"text": "عَنكُمْ ۚ", "translation": "for you"}, {"text": "وَخُلِقَ", "translation": "and was created"}, {"text": "ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ", "translation": "the mankind"}, {"text": "ضَعِيفًۭا", "translation": "weak"}], "sahih": "And Allāh wants to lighten for you [your difficulties]; and mankind was created weak."}